// × 4) — pre-integrated DDGI SH L0 + L1 coefficients (RGB = raw coefficient,
// A = validity). One texel fetch per coefficient replaces the 16-read
// tetrahedral query below, and the evaluation is DIRECTIONAL: the old
// DC-only cascade lost all direction information (9→1 downgrade). Stored
// value is the raw L0 coefficient now, so the evaluation applies C0 itself.
// Bound textures are the previous frame's cascade (temporal EMA implies ≥1
// frame of lag anyway). Extent derivation must match DispatchCascadeUpdate.
